; first night — a tour of Sleepcousonique
; faders fader1-fader4, track buttons button1-button4, the rocker is rocker, PLAY is play, •• is dots
; change scene: hold the dots and press the rocker (•• + FFWD / RWD)
drift 3

2026-11-13
----------
; a fountain, a fold, a lamp on a photocell
the voice is crossfm 3
the peaks are folder
the window is lpg
the stairs are slope
the dice are steprandom 2

stairs.end -> stairs.trig          ; the staircase climbs forever
stairs.end >| window.level          ; each landing pings the window: bongo
dice => peaks.fold                  ; random folding, through water
fader1 -> voice.index
fader2 -> stairs.rise stairs.fall
voice -> peaks -> window -> out leds

2026-10-08
----------
; the train over clear water between dark umber mountains
the route is seq 8: 0 7 12 15 12 7 3 -5
the tick is slope
the bell is bell 2
the voice is sine 2
the hall is delay 9

tick.end -> tick.trig route.next
tick.end >| bell.strike
route ~70> voice.pitch
voice bell -> hall
hall -> out
fader1 -> hall.feedback
fader2 -> tick.fall

2026-02-07
----------
; a golden square of moss in a night pond; fader1 makes it bloom
the moss is granular 2
the night is reverb 3

fader1 -> moss.density
moss -> night -> out
frogs4 ~40> night
